9,PDF Melanesia - Wesleyan University,https://musc102.blogs.wesleyan.edu/files/2021/03/Steven-Feld_Melanesia.pdf,"PNG's Popular Music Papua New Guinea's exposure to Western sounds began in the last quarter of the nineteenth century, with the part harmony of church hymns sung in local languages. By the turn of the century, mission songs, colonial songs and gold-rush songs had also made their mark.",Makayam,Trans-New Guinea
